  "Testing…": "正在測試…", "That service is no longer available — pick another service to connect, or cancel. Nothing typed here can go to a different service.": "此服務已無法使用。請選擇其他服務進行連線，或取消。此處輸入的任何內容都不會送往其他服務。", "That service is not available for setup — it may have been removed or its reviewed enrollment metadata could not be read.": "此服務無法設定。它可能已被移除，或其經審查的註冊中繼資料無法讀取。", "The board's access check did not answer, so email sending stays closed.": "看板的存取檢查沒有回應，因此電子郵件寄送保持關閉。", "The check did not return a readable result — treat this as a configuration problem, not a connection that works.": "檢查未回傳可讀取的結果 — 請將此視為設定問題，而非可正常運作的連線。", "The check did not return this connection's current state — treat this as a configuration problem, not a connection that works.": "檢查未回傳此連線的目前狀態 — 請將此視為設定問題，而非可正常運作的連線。",
  "The chosen sender needs re-checking. Choose it again below to continue sending.": "所選寄件者需要重新檢查。請於下方重新選擇以繼續寄送。", "The command head matches literally. Each remaining argument must match its saved pattern, with the same argument count and exact working folder. A trailing * matches only at a path boundary.": "指令本身按字面相符。其餘每個引數都必須符合其已儲存的模式，且引數數量與工作資料夾需完全相同。結尾的 * 只會在路徑邊界處相符。", "The connected platform did not return an account summary.": "已連接的平台未回傳帳戶摘要。", "The daemon cannot isolate this credential from agents using the same system account, so it refused to store it — nothing was stored. To save it anyway, tick the storage-consent box below, then retry — it is never pre-selected.": "daemon 無法將此憑證與使用同一系統帳戶的代理程式隔離，因此拒絕儲存 — 未儲存任何內容。若仍要儲存，請勾選下方的儲存同意方塊後重試；此選項永遠不會預先勾選。", "The daemon is not reachable. Settings stay unchanged until it answers.": "無法連上 daemon。在其回應之前，設定將保持不變。", "The exact workspace ID from the device exchange —": "來自裝置交換的確切工作區 ID —",
  "The latest approved release is installed.": "已安裝最新已核准的版本。", "The local configuration could not be read — treat this as a configuration problem, not a connection that works.": "無法讀取本機設定 — 請將此視為設定問題，而非可正常運作的連線。", "The master may need permission again.": "主控可能需要再次取得權限。", "The new release passed its health check.": "新版本已通過健康檢查。", "The password travels inside this one request to daemon custody and is cleared from this form afterwards. Never paste a credential anywhere else on this board.": "密碼只會在此次請求中傳送至 daemon 保管，之後會從此表單清除。請勿在此看板的其他地方貼上任何憑證。", "The previous release was restored. Review the progress log before trying again.": "已還原先前的版本。請先檢視進度紀錄，再重試。",
