  "Workspace app · reviewed drafts and Local release": "工作區應用程式 · 已審查的草稿與本機發布", "Refreshing in the background": "正在背景重新整理", "Read-only view. A verified operator can configure the app, approve runs and release drafts.": "唯讀檢視。已驗證的操作員可設定應用程式、核准執行並發布草稿。", "Workspace app": "工作區應用程式", "Could not load workspace apps": "無法載入工作區應用程式", "Loading planned posts…": "正在載入已排程的貼文…",
